cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyGWRx in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "pyGWRx: Geographically weighted modelling in Python"
abstract: >-
  pyGWRx provides geographically weighted regression, multiscale,
  spatio-temporal, robust, generalized, diagnostic, and exploratory spatial
  modelling methods with reproducible datasets, examples, and documentation.
type: software
